  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/41554511515.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 141px;\" /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/96564154.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 252px;\" /><br />&nbsp;<div><p><i><span style=\"color:black\">u </span></i><span>is the relative velocity of the particle with respect to the box. Resolve <i>u</i>.<br /><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>u</mi> <mi>x</mi> </msub> </mrow> </math> </span>&nbsp;is the relative velocity of the particle with respect to the box in <i>x</i>&nbsp;–&nbsp;direction.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>u</mi> <mi>y</mi> </msub> </mrow> </math> </span><span>is the relative velocity of the particle with respect to the box in <i>y</i>&nbsp;–&nbsp;direction.</span></p><p><span>Since there is no velocity of the box in the <i>y</i>&nbsp;–&nbsp;direction, therefore this is the vertical velocity of the particle with respect to ground also.</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><i><span>Y</span></i><span style=\";\"> –&nbsp;direction motion (Taking relative terms w.r.t. box)</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>u</mi> <mi>y</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>α</mi> </mrow> </math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>a</mi> <mi>y</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mo></mo><mo></mo><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>S</mi> <mi>y</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;(activity is taken till the time the particle comes back to the box) </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>t</mi> <mi>y</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi> </mrow> </math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>Using, &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mi>a</mi><msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math> we get–</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mtable columnalign=\"left\"> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>α</mi> </mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>×</mo><msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn></mn><mn></mn><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>α</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><i><span>X</span></i><span>-direction motion (Taking relative terms w.r.t. box)</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mtable columnalign=\"left\"> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mi>u</mi> <mi>x</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>α</mi> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mi>a</mi> <mi>x</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>Again, using <math> <mrow> <mtext> </mtext><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mi>a</mi><msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;we get –</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mo>⇒</mo> </math> </span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>S</mi> <mi>x</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn></mn><mn></mn><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>α</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mi>u</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mrow><mo>[</mo> <mrow> <mo>∵</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mi>t</mi> <mi>x</mi> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn></mn><mn></mn><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>α</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> <mo>]</mo></mrow> </mrow> </math> </span></p></div>",
